# Installed to /etc/cron.d/dashboard. Fields: m h dom mon dow user command
#
# Runs on the hour and the half hour. Output goes to PID 1's stdout -- the
# container's stdout -- so `bottle logs alan-dashboard` shows each run. Without
# that redirect cron would try to mail the output and it would be lost.
#
# Change the schedule here and rebuild; DASHBOARD_REFRESH_SECONDS should stay a
# little longer than the interval so the page reloads just after a rebuild.
*/30 * * * * root /app/bin/generate.sh >> /proc/1/fd/1 2>&1
